# 🪟 Windows Administration

## Computer Management

Computer Management is a Windows administrative console that combines multiple management tools into a single interface.

Run:

```text
Windows + R

compmgmt.msc
```

---

## Tools Available in Computer Management

* Event Viewer
* Device Manager
* Disk Management
* Shared Folders
* Local Users & Groups
* Services
* Task Scheduler

---

## Why IT Administrators Use Computer Management

Instead of opening multiple Windows tools individually, administrators can manage many system components from one console.

